nEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"CANuOWl6Z4soWkK2_1NWcw","review_id":"VeX61Tjckcq2-TEnVgBTxw","date":"2019-04-04T19:29:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9366962909698486,"text_excerpt":"First time in New Orleans and this was the first place we decided to check out for lunch. It wasn't too busy when we went so service was generally fast. Our server was super nice and the food was good. I got a shrimp poboy, which was huge. I could only eat half. My sister got fish and chips which she enjoyed. I also love that they serve potatoes with butter instead of bread and butter. I'd probably go again if I'm ever back to visit."},{"business_id":"CANuOWl6Z4soWkK2_1NWcw","review_id":"3GLK3ocVxVqC7sf0LW0hDw","date":"2019-03-16T00:17:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.935069739818573,"text_excerpt":"My son who lives in Nola says that this is his favorite everyday seafood place. There is no dress code! It's outside the quarter, with good street parking. When you walk in a super friendly hostess will greet you and seat you. This is a lively open kitchen place that promises and delivers on great fried seafood. Instead if a bread basket they bring you a bowl of boiled potatoes and butter.....someday people will say it started at Deanie's in Nola. We started with bbq oysters. They were great but my only recommendation would be , that I would request the smallest oysters they have. Sometimes you get a mix of large and small and I think that creates in even cooking . There seafood gumbo com..."},{"business_id":"CANuOWl6Z4soWkK2_1NWcw","review_id":"FMxXPfpamftxGDFWLLbFzA","date":"2019-08-21T14:39:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9312044978141785,"text_excerpt":"I love this place... for a lot reasons, starting with the people. I can't remember our waiters name, and he's a sailor so out to sea possibly when you go, but he's the best. Here's another reason: bowl of boiled potatoes with a nice kick comes to every table. (Like a bread basket, but better) And the best reason: their cocktail game is on point. (See pic of the Street Car for $10 and that's the only one you'll need! Walk or Uber my friend) BBQ shrimp tacos fantastic. (Side note: menu says they come with vegetable side but mine came with fries, which are unusually good here so all the better) Husband had the shrimp and catfish basket and we took a soft shell crab Po-boy home to the daughte..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"CANuOWl6Z4soWkK2_1NWcw","photo_id":"oQvsP_2F72e6UwDiSL3X9A","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/oQvsP_2F72e6UwDiSL3X9A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8707810640335083},{"business_id":"CANuOWl6Z4soWkK2_1NWcw","photo_id":"5p9f_nZRGqHTeZPnOrYODQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5p9f_nZRGqHTeZPnOrYODQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8387659788131714},{"business_id":"CANuOWl6Z4soWkK2_1NWcw","photo_id":"VE-9Wh4BGtcI1T6bJFNhTQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VE-9Wh4BGtcI1T6bJFNhTQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8353029489517212},{"business_id":"CA